+# Fix ticket notifications in Slack
+
+Messages about a specific report, such as **A report was opened**, show a
+clickable **Ticket #2** label. Select it to open that ticket in the Member Portal.
+
+Select **Open ticket in Slack** to open the ticket's private Slack view, just
+as if you had typed `/fix 2`. Replace 2 with your ticket's number when using
+the command. Available actions depend on your current ticket permissions;
+an old message does not grant access after those permissions change.
+
+Previously delivered messages keep their original format.
